+tric uniformly.
+A possible explanation for the mixed result on ML-1
+M is that thresholding changes the information suppli
+ed by the additional rating-based branch, and combin
+ing this information with the interaction-based predic
+tions may alter the ordering of recommended items.
+Such changes need not benefit all ranking metrics si
+multaneously. However, the reported results alone do
+not establish the cause of the decrease or its statistic
+al significance. The decrease should therefore be ack
+nowledged as a limitation of the observed improveme
+nt rather than dismissed as random variation.
