+improvement of 7.89%. For the Ratings5 results on
+ML-Latest-Small, the HiGSP and rating-based predi
+ctions are combined with weights of 0.7 and 0.3, resp
+ectively. The corresponding weights for ML-1M are
+0.8 and 0.2. These dataset-specific combination weig
+hts should be considered when interpreting difference
+s between Ratings2 and Ratings5; the observed differ
+ences should not be attributed solely to the rating thr
+eshold.
+CiaoDVD exhibits a clear difference between the tw
